<title>USA: Cable &amp; Co sees 1996 revs $17 mln.</title>
<headline>Cable &amp; Co sees 1996 revs $17 mln.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cable &amp; Co Worldwide Inc said on Friday that it projects gross revenues of $17 million in 1996 and about $20 million in 1997.</p>
<p>No further details were available.</p>
<p>The company designs and markets footwear.</p>
</text>
